# FinCore — Digital Banking Management Platform

> A full-stack digital banking management platform built with Angular and Spring Boot microservices for managing customers, accounts, transactions, and operational dashboard analytics.

![Angular](https://img.shields.io/badge/Angular-21-red?logo=angular)
![Spring Boot](https://img.shields.io/badge/Spring%20Boot-3.x-brightgreen?logo=springboot)
![Java](https://img.shields.io/badge/Java-17%2B-orange?logo=openjdk)
![PostgreSQL](https://img.shields.io/badge/PostgreSQL-Database-336791?logo=postgresql)
![TypeScript](https://img.shields.io/badge/TypeScript-5.9-blue?logo=typescript)
![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-Educational-lightgrey)

---

## 📌 Overview

**FinCore** is a modular digital banking management platform designed around a microservices architecture.

The system separates core banking responsibilities into independent services:

- 👤 Customer management
- 💳 Account management
- 💸 Transaction processing
- 📊 Dashboard and banking statistics

The frontend is an Angular application that communicates with the backend services through an Angular development proxy.

The project is designed to demonstrate practical full-stack engineering concepts including:

- REST API design
- Spring Boot microservices
- Angular feature-based architecture
- JPA/Hibernate persistence
- PostgreSQL integration
- DTO-based API communication
- OpenFeign service-to-service communication
- Form validation
- Role/permission-aware frontend routing
- Dashboard analytics
- Transaction workflows
- API health monitoring

---

# 🏗️ System Architecture

```text
                         ┌──────────────────────────┐
                         │      Angular Frontend    │
                         │       Port: 4200         │
                         └────────────┬─────────────┘
                                      │
                              Angular Proxy
                                      │
          ┌───────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────┐
          │                           │                           │
          ▼                           ▼                           ▼
 ┌─────────────────┐         ┌─────────────────┐        ┌─────────────────┐
 │ Customer Service│         │ Account Service │        │Transaction       │
 │    Port 8081    │         │    Port 8082    │        │Service Port 8083│
 └────────┬────────┘         └────────┬────────┘        └────────┬────────┘
          │                           │                           │
          └───────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────┘
                                      │
                                      ▼
                              ┌─────────────────┐
                              │ PostgreSQL      │
                              │    fincore      │
                              └─────────────────┘


                         ┌──────────────────────────┐
                         │    Dashboard Service    │
                         │       Port: 8084        │
                         └────────────┬─────────────┘
                                      │
                           OpenFeign REST Clients
                                      │
                 ┌────────────────────┼────────────────────┐
                 ▼                    ▼                    ▼
          Customer Service     Account Service      Transaction Service
              :8081                :8082                 :8083
```

### Service responsibilities

| Service | Port | Responsibility |
|---|---:|---|
| Customer Service | `8081` | Customer CRUD, search, KYC status, customer statistics |
| Account Service | `8082` | Account management, account lookup, status, statistics, credit/debit |
| Transaction Service | `8083` | Deposits, withdrawals, transfers, history, transaction statistics |
| Dashboard Service | `8084` | Aggregates customer, account and transaction information |
| Angular Frontend | `4200` | Banking management UI |

---

# ✨ Features

## 👤 Customer Management

The customer module provides:

- Customer listing
- Customer search
- Customer details
- Customer creation
- Customer update
- Customer deletion
- Customer number lookup
- KYC status filtering
- KYC status updates
- Customer statistics
- Loading and empty states
- Validation and notifications

### Customer API

Base URL:

```text
http://localhost:8081/api/v1/customers
```

Available operations include:

```text
GET     /api/v1/customers
GET     /api/v1/customers/{id}
GET     /api/v1/customers/number/{customerNumber}
GET     /api/v1/customers/kyc-status/{kycStatus}
GET     /api/v1/customers/search
GET     /api/v1/customers/statistics
PUT     /api/v1/customers/{id}
PATCH   /api/v1/customers/{id}/kyc-status
DELETE  /api/v1/customers/{id}
```

---

# 💳 Account Management

The account module provides:

- Account listing
- Account details
- Account lookup by account number
- Account update
- Account status management
- Account deletion
- Account statistics
- Credit operation
- Debit operation
- Account filtering
- Account summary cards
- Account status indicators

### Account API

Base URL:

```text
http://localhost:8082/api/v1/accounts
```

Available operations include:

```text
GET     /api/v1/accounts
GET     /api/v1/accounts/statistics
GET     /api/v1/accounts/{id}
GET     /api/v1/accounts/number/{accountNumber}
PUT     /api/v1/accounts/{id}
PATCH   /api/v1/accounts/{id}/status
DELETE  /api/v1/accounts/{id}
POST    /api/v1/accounts/{accountNumber}/credit
POST    /api/v1/accounts/{accountNumber}/debit
```

---

# 💸 Transaction Management

The transaction module supports banking operations such as:

- Deposit
- Withdrawal
- Transfer
- Recent transactions
- Transaction history by account
- Transaction statistics
- Transaction filtering
- Transaction details
- Transaction status display
- Transaction summary information

### Transaction API

Base URL:

```text
http://localhost:8083/api/v1/transactions
```

Available operations include:

```text
POST    /api/v1/transactions/deposit
POST    /api/v1/transactions/withdraw
POST    /api/v1/transactions/transfer
GET     /api/v1/transactions/statistics
GET     /api/v1/transactions/recent
GET     /api/v1/transactions/history/{accountNumber}
```

---

# 📊 Dashboard

The Dashboard Service aggregates information from the other backend services.

It uses **Spring Cloud OpenFeign** to communicate with:

- Customer Service
- Account Service
- Transaction Service

### Dashboard API

Base URL:

```text
http://localhost:8084/api/v1/dashboard
```

Available operations:

```text
GET /api/v1/dashboard/summary
GET /api/v1/dashboard/customer-statistics
GET /api/v1/dashboard/account-statistics
GET /api/v1/dashboard/transaction-statistics
GET /api/v1/dashboard/recent-transactions
```

The Angular dashboard provides UI components for:

- Welcome banner
- Statistics
- Quick actions
- Charts
- Recent transactions
- Activity timeline
- Notifications

