# ⭐ Project Summary

**FinCore Digital Banking Management Platform** is a full-stack banking application demonstrating how a modern Angular frontend can communicate with multiple Spring Boot microservices.

The architecture separates customer, account, transaction, and dashboard responsibilities while using REST APIs, PostgreSQL, JPA/Hibernate, and OpenFeign to create a modular banking management system.

```text
Angular 21
    +
Spring Boot Microservices
    +
PostgreSQL
    +
REST APIs
    +
OpenFeign
    =
FinCore Digital Banking Platform
```

If you find the project useful, consider giving the repository a ⭐.
